WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A room is not neutral. Examine how environmental conditions shape different experiences.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Read light, sound and layout.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Include task, timing and control.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Compare different people and goals.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Keep uncertainty visible.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Design space from lived response.
